_-QOxh0x9j_mKJULGfbQYJV-jLTZGmglTCN-AhTEubskz3DVWEut_7yVL22xrdKRESbHSJZ5EUmgI913OPlRbJSkzQsc1kDCOWaSm7DSqK12Hewku9sOXaNLQWdjLV9qyXflGXZ5bnDdhZAbfk/s1054/O1CN01aAvqVD2CZ6NAnJ4So_!!2528448487.avif.jpg&quot; imageanchor=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;&quot;&gt;&lt;img border=&quot;0&quot; data-original-height=&quot;1054&quot; data-original-width=&quot;750&quot; height=&quot;640&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjoGXuyUJ-a6deKJiLsY2y6LqbwQpCRwPd4vVQCIA8nq_-QOxh0x9j_mKJULGfbQYJV-jLTZGmglTCN-AhTEubskz3DVWEut_7yVL22xrdKRESbHSJZ5EUmgI913OPlRbJSkzQsc1kDCOWaSm7DSqK12Hewku9sOXaNLQWdjLV9qyXflGXZ5bnDdhZAbfk/w456-h640/O1CN01aAvqVD2CZ6NAnJ4So_!!2528448487.avif.jpg&quot; width=&quot;456&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&quot;Morning and Evening: With PUJi Original Design Cla-style Color-blocked OP with Detachable Embroidered Faux Collar Lolita Dress&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Design Inspiration&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&quot;The chimes of Rome echo through the remnants of history. This two-piece set includes an OP dress and an embroidered faux collar. The dress features a simple black and white color scheme, with the main design focus on the skirt. The skirt boasts a circumference of over 4 meters, with white color-blocked inserts on the sides to add volume. The inserts are adorned with eight hand-sewn chrysanthemum eyelets, adding delicate details. The embroidered faux collar features Roman numerals, exuding a classic European feel. Paired with a bow and gemstone brooch, the overall look is imbued with a mysterious and elegant atmosphere.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgjcrFJvQEr0MViFm3-ryELCpFJIl6bLFEXq7n53U4F_QuhoKH29isctfcLO9T7FykIUAe4p3cOR6lT4CpTNN1QhWmr2Od_29LegijFGWkwZ2IGQNQ8DnI566I-gYFT-UD8KFd7Y7cd33Xf4H4z_UKC7S_NAyu5DgIT_H9ZJmK4r5yhVug7gnFA_x6gVPg/s1069/O1CN016TgXvd2CZ6NB09M8w_!!2528448487.avif.jpg&quot; imageanchor=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img border=&quot;0&quot; data-original-height=&quot;1069&quot; data-original-width=&quot;750&quot; height=&quot;640&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgjcrFJvQEr0MViFm3-ryELCpFJIl6bLFEXq7n53U4F_QuhoKH29isctfcLO9T7FykIUAe4p3cOR6lT4CpTNN1QhWmr2Od_29LegijFGWkwZ2IGQNQ8DnI566I-gYFT-UD8KFd7Y7cd33Xf4H4z_UKC7S_NAyu5DgIT_H9ZJmK4r5yhVug7gnFA_x6gVPg/w450-h640/O1CN016TgXvd2CZ6NB09M8w_!!2528448487.avif.jpg&quot; width=&quot;450&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Introducing the &quot;Morning and Evening&quot; OP by With PUJi, a captivating blend of classic and modern design elements. This original design features a Cla-style color-blocked OP dress paired with a detachable embroidered faux collar, creating a versatile and stylish ensemble.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The inspiration for this piece comes from the timeless echoes of Roman chimes, resonating through the corridors of history. The dress is primarily black and white, offering a clean and sophisticated look. The skirt is the highlight of this design, with an impressive circumference of over 4 meters, enhanced by white color-blocked inserts that increase the skirt&#39;s volume. Each insert is detailed with eight hand-sewn chrysanthemum eyelets, adding a touch of meticulous craftsmanship.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The detachable faux collar is embroidered with Roman numerals, lending a classic European charm to the dress. The addition of a bow and gemstone brooch further elevates the design, infusing it with a mysterious and elegant ambiance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Perfect for any Lolita fashion enthusiast, the &quot;Morning and Evening&quot; OP is a testament to With PUJi&#39;s dedication to quality and detail. This dress is ideal for those seeking a unique and timeless piece that combines historical inspiration with contemporary design.&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.withpuji.com/2024/06/morning-and-evening-with-puji-original.html</link><author>noreply@blogger.com (Unknown)</author><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjoGXuyUJ-a6deKJiLsY2y6LqbwQpCRwPd4vVQCIA8nq_-QOxh0x9j_mKJULGfbQYJV-jLTZGmglTCN-AhTEubskz3DVWEut_7yVL22xrdKRESbHSJZ5EUmgI913OPlRbJSkzQsc1kDCOWaSm7DSqK12Hewku9sOXaNLQWdjLV9qyXflGXZ5bnDdhZAbfk/s72-w456-h640-c/O1CN01aAvqVD2CZ6NAnJ4So_!!2528448487.avif.jpg" height="72" width="72"/><thr:total>0</thr:total></item><item><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-4407422256984396335.post-8870176706226300688</guid><pubDate>Sun, 09 Jun 2024 17:21:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:updated>2024-06-09T10:23:32.259-07:00</atom:updated><title>Floating Light Melody Lolita OP</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiaHTDUWo4ebFbM16naI7MRLynG7CtjXvMdPtghztCVPzAhtErLBHeaz7uqrQ32J5VmHx2_Q8W4em8ABh3O8V5GargIPwjtB41G1YluN1xWuvkFU1Cx5hIb9lt9Zq6PIjaJPO5YArcOekSQ544QIvfamEd5t9FG1BBKhfZilmZuLynFS2833OpY1zcpT_I/s1081/1.jpg&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;&quot;&gt;&lt;img border=&quot;0&quot; data-original-height=&quot;1081&quot; data-original-width=&quot;750&quot; height=&quot;640&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiaHTDUWo4ebFbM16naI7MRLynG7CtjXvMdPtghztCVPzAhtErLBHeaz7uqrQ32J5VmHx2_Q8W4em8ABh3O8V5GargIPwjtB41G1YluN1xWuvkFU1Cx5hIb9lt9Zq6PIjaJPO5YArcOekSQ544QIvfamEd5t9FG1BBKhfZilmZuLynFS2833OpY1zcpT_I/w444-h640/1.jpg&quot; width=&quot;444&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Design Inspiration&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&quot;As dawn breaks, sunlight paints the day. The morning light pours into floating dreams, intertwining with the sea. Even the wind carries fragments of sunlight, playing a rhythm that stirs the heart.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Introduction&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;This summer Lolita dress features a V-neck adorned with delicate lace, embodying the timeless elegance of Cla-style fashion. The dress is a perfect blend of comfort and style, crafted from breathable cotton to keep you cool on warm days.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The design inspiration draws from the tranquil moments at dawn, where the first rays of sunlight dance over the sea, creating a symphony of light and wind. This dress reflects that ethereal beauty, with layers of fabric and lace that mimic the soft glow of morning light. The intricate details and classic color palette make it a versatile piece for daily wear, while still evoking the dreamy essence of Lolita fashion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Experience the magic of dawn with the &quot;Floating Light Melody OP&quot; and let it become a staple in your summer wardrobe, offering both comfort and an exquisite touch of elegance.&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://www.withpuji.com/2024/06/floating-light-melody-lolita-op.html</link><author>noreply@blogger.com (Unknown)</author><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiaHTDUWo4ebFbM16naI7MRLynG7CtjXvMdPtghztCVPzAhtErLBHeaz7uqrQ32J5VmHx2_Q8W4em8ABh3O8V5GargIPwjtB41G1YluN1xWuvkFU1Cx5hIb9lt9Zq6PIjaJPO5YArcOekSQ544QIvfamEd5t9FG1BBKhfZilmZuLynFS2833OpY1zcpT_I/s72-w444-h640-c/1.jpg" height="72" width="72"/><thr:total>0</thr:total></item><item><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-4407422256984396335.post-8218559400123199416</guid><pubDate>Sun, 09 Jun 2024 17:05:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:updated>2024-06-09T10:05:32.860-07:00</atom:updated><title>Black Chapter Seventh Night Short Sleeves Multi-Layer Ruffle Bowknot Sweet Lolita Dress</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgHZDLziio-P7tMtaLrLdSj9eIAQWPO85OZR1U8zclw845Xz48LHTPR8qutHguwuwb1cjtV0UQXD3eXtAiKqZsDkpnDopPUqmA1Av50eIZAEllSztvf_90aVc3WJ40BAQzJj2QpL_rvpPWtvO6W8tnVoV2gbr6HOm1aoOL2P6mICFPboPzbf0L8S4jtQdk/s974/1%20(1).jpg&quot; imageanchor=&quot;1&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;&quot;&gt;&lt;img border=&quot;0&quot; data-original-height=&quot;974&quot; data-original-width=&quot;750&quot; height=&quot;640&quot; src=&quot;https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgHZDLziio-P7tMtaLrLdSj9eIAQWPO85OZR1U8zclw845Xz48LHTPR8qutHguwuwb1cjtV0UQXD3eXtAiKqZsDkpnDopPUqmA1Av50eIZAEllSztvf_90aVc3WJ40BAQzJj2QpL_rvpPWtvO6W8tnVoV2gbr6HOm1aoOL2P6mICFPboPzbf0L8S4jtQdk/w493-h640/1%20(1).jpg&quot; width=&quot;493&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Design inspiration:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&quot;The clock strikes twelve in the ancient castle, and an elegant symphony emerges from the depths of the night.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This vintage-inspired cotton OP dress features a classic and timeless combination of dark green and black. The dress is made from pure cotton fabric, ensuring comfort and breathability. The slightly low waist design highlights the narrowest part of the waist, while the waist ties provide a snug fit. The contrasting green lace adds layers to the dress. The underskirt has an elastic waistband that fits various body shapes, and the double-layer ruffled hem adds more dimension. The detachable princess sleeves and bonnet enhance the doll-like feel with every movement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Video:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;separator&quot; style=&quot;clear: both; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe allowfullscreen=&#39;allowfullscreen&#39; webkitallowfullscreen=&#39;webkitallowfullscreen&#39; mozallowfullscreen=&#39;mozallowfullscreen&#39; width=&#39;523&#39; height=&#39;435&#39; src=&#39;https://www.blogger.com/video.g?token=AD6v5dzjqaCk_q8